      "number": 25,
      "answer": "$9$",
      "solution": "$n=a_{m} \\times 10^{m}+\\cdots+a_{2} \\times 10^{2}+a_{1} \\times 10+a_{0}$일 때,\n$f(a_{m} \\times 10^{m}+\\cdots+a_{2} \\times 10^{2}+a_{1} \\times 10+a_{0})$\n$=f(a_{m} \\times 10^{m-1}+\\cdots+a_{2} \\times 10+a_{1})+a_{0}$\n$=f(a_{m} \\times 10^{m-2}+\\cdots+a_{2})+a_{1}+a_{0}$\n$\\vdots$\n$=a_{m}+\\cdots+a_{2}+a_{1}+a_{0}$\n$\\therefore f(n)=a_{m}+\\cdots+a_{2}+a_{1}+a_{0}$\n$(f \\circ f)(999)=f(27)=9$",
      "topic": "",
      "difficulty": ""
